ring a sleek black evening gown.\n\n<Subject 3> is the Royal Alexandra Theatre in <Picture 1>, a large historic stone building with a prominent marquee, \"Royal Alexandra Theatre\" signage, and a red carpet leading to a set of stairs.\n\n<Subject 4> is the crowd of photographers and fans at the red carpet event, holding cameras and phones.\n\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video features <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> standing on the red carpet in front of <Subject 3>. They pose for <Subject 4> as the cameras flash incessantly. They share a brief, intimate moment of dialogue amidst the chaos.\n\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - Adam Driver's appearance in a dark suit is retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - Scarlett Johansson's appearance in a black gown is retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the historic facade of the Royal Alexandra Theatre and its marquee are retained.\n<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the photographers and the red carpet atmosphere are retained.\n\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is in a live-action cinematic style with the bright, slightly harsh lighting of a daytime outdoor red carpet event.\n\n[Shot 1] The scene opens in a medium-wide shot from <Picture 1>, showing the Royal Alexandra Theatre with its ornate architecture and \"Royal Alexandra Theatre\" marquee. <Subject 1>, the actor Adam Driver in a dark suit, and <Subject 2>, the actress Scarlett Johansson in a black evening gown, stand side-by-side on the red carpet in the foreground. They are surrounded by <Subject 4>, the photographers who are relentlessly clicking their cameras and raising their phones, creating a barrage of white flashes that illuminate the subjects' faces. The camera holds a static shot as the subjects maintain a poised, professional pose for the press. <Subject 2> (S1) leans in slightly toward <Subject 1> and whispers in a soft, playful voice, <d>[English] Do you think we've been standing here long enough for them to get the perfect shot?</d> <Subject 1> (S2) keeps his face turned toward the cameras but speaks in a low, warm rumble of a voice, <d>[English] Just one more minute, then we can finally go find some real food.</d> The shot ends as they both hold a slight, knowing smirk for the final flash of the cameras.\n\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA constant, chaotic layer of rapid-fire camera shutters clicking, the low roar of a distant crowd, and the muffled sounds of many people talking at once.\n\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"],"widgets_values_named":{"value":"subject_definitions:\n\n<Subject 1> is the actor Adam Driver in <Video 1>, who has a rugged appearance with a short beard and messy hair, wearing a sophisticated dark tailored suit.\n\n<Subject 2> is the actress Scarlett Johansson in <Video 2>, with long blonde hair and a glamorous look, wearing a sleek black evening gown.\n\n<Subject 3> is the Royal Alexandra Theatre in <Picture 1>, a large historic stone building with a prominent marquee, \"Royal Alexandra Theatre\" signage, and a red carpet leading to a set of stairs.\n\n<Subject 4> is the crowd of photographers and fans at the red carpet event, holding cameras and phones.\n\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video features <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> standing on the red carpet in front of <Subject 3>. They pose for <Subject 4> as the cameras flash incessantly. They share a brief, intimate moment of dialogue amidst the chaos.\n\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - Adam Driver's appearance in a dark suit is retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - Scarlett Johansson's appearance in a black gown is retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the historic facade of the Royal Alexandra Theatre and its marquee are retained.\n<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the photographers and 